random : Used to generating random values, simulations, and testing
-------
1. randint(start, stop): It will generate random number from start to stop.
-----------
import random
st=int(input("Enter starting number: "))
ed=int(input("Enter ending number: "))

print(random.randint(st,ed))

Output
-----
Enter starting number:1
Enter ending number:10
2

2. choice(List) : It will return only one value from your list
-----------------
import random
l1=[10,20,30,40,50]
print(random.choice(l1))

Output
------
20

3. Shuffle(list) : It will shuffle list then return it
----------------
import random
l1=[8,12,9,15,6]
print(random.shuffle(l1))
Output
-------
None

